| +12 additional | various | CEX/DEX | Mixed |

**CORS Proxy Architecture:**
The `smartFetch()` function implements a three-tier fetch strategy:
1. Direct fetch (if CORS-safe exchange)
2. Built-in rotating proxy (`corsproxy.io`, `allorigins.win`)
3. Custom user-provided proxy URL

